The Details Dashboard is go-to interface for accessing vital loan data. Designed for comprehensive insights into our loan portfolio, borrower 
profiles, and loan performance, it's a one-stop solution for data enthusiasts seeking detailed information. 
In Bank Loan Report project, we leverage Tableau to visually represent critical loan-related metrics and trends. Dive into a variety of charts 
offering a clear and insightful view of our bending operations. This visualization journey enables data-driven decision-making, providing 
valuable insights into various loan parameters.
